MOTION FOR LEAVE TO RESPOND AND 
LIMITED RESPONSE OF BUCKEYE POWER, INC.
Pursuant to Rules 212 and 213 of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission’s 
(“Commission”) Rules of Practice and Procedure,1 Buckeye Power, Inc. (“Buckeye”) respectfully 
moves for leave to respond and submits the following brief response to the May 8, 2025 Answer 
of Vistra Corp. (“Vistra”).2 The Limited Response below addresses only one aspect of Vistra’s 
Answer: potential retail “financial commitment” requirements for new large load interconnection.3 
Such retail “financial commitments” may have some benefit, but on their own they do not go far 
